{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemorylease", "label": "InMemoryLease", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The dev/test Lease implementation. Fine for unit tests, local dev and single-process MultiNodeSpec, useless in production: it survives no restart, is not shared across processes and protects against no real split brain."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemoryleasestore", "label": "inMemoryLeaseStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single module-global store \u2014 no per-instance registry to wire \u2014 so two leases sharing a name exclude each other automatically. acquire() CASes the slot atomically; the exported singleton can be cleared between tests with _clear()."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_required_fields", "label": "InMemoryLease required fields", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "name, owner and ttlMs throw OptionsError when missing rather than building a lease that can exclude nobody: two leases without owner both contend under the same undefined holder and both win, and without ttlMs the expiry is NaN, which never lies after now, so any existing holder reads as expired."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_single_process_only", "label": "Single-process mutual exclusion only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Separate processes each get their own store and cannot see each other's leases, so ParallelMultiNodeSpec tests either fall back to a truly distributed lease or stay on the single-process MultiNodeSpec."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_real_timers", "label": "Real timers, no scheduler injection", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "setInterval renewal and a setTimeout-driven TTL sweep with no ManualScheduler hook \u2014 deterministic lease-timing tests have to mock Date.now()."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemorylease", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_lease_api_lease", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemorylease", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemoryleasestore", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_required_fields", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemorylease", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_coordination_in_memory_lease_single_process_only", 